# Coder report — exp_11 `orientation_cue_fairness`, ROUND 2 **FIX CYCLE 5**

**Coder:** Claude Opus 5 (1M context), Claude Code
**Worktree:** `/home/yixunhu/codespace/xRIR_code_wt`, branch `exp11-cue`, from the reviewed tip `4f72ac2`
